# MASTER IMPLEMENTATION PROMPT: COMPLETE THE KORD COURSE CATALOGUE FOR ALL 99 COMPETENCIES

## PROJECT

Repository: https://github.com/ethoppaofficial/Kord

Application: Kord Skill Development Platform

Primary objective: Expand the existing course catalogue so that every published competency has a properly developed, relevant and functional course containing modules, lessons, learning resources, assessments and practical assignments.

This is an extension of an existing application.

**STRICT INSTRUCTION: Do not rewrite the application. Do not replace its architecture. Extend and improve the existing vanilla JavaScript and Supabase implementation.**

---

